description: Requires agent-generated, OS-adapted runtime tooling and protected execution.
alwaysApply: true
---
# OJ Agent-Generated Toolchain

- Do not depend on pre-written runtime Python/C++ tools shipped by the bundle.
- Generate the required native tooling for the detected operating system.
- Prefer C++20, falling back to C++17.
- Prefer C++ for executable problem/tooling components.
- Protected executions are limited to 1 GiB RAM and 1 second; exceeding a limit requires process-tree termination.
- Use native OS APIs for enforcement when available.
